sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant VM as ViewModel
    participant Room as Room (SSOT)
    participant Out as Outbox
    participant W as SyncWorker (Ch 30)
    participant Srv as Backend

    User->>VM: add to wishlist (offline)
    VM->>Room: optimistic insert (syncStatus=PENDING)
    VM->>Out: enqueue mutation (idempotency key)
    Room-->>VM: Flow emits -> UI shows item instantly
    Note over W: connectivity returns -> WorkManager runs
    W->>Out: read pending mutations
    W->>Srv: POST wishlist (Idempotency-Key)
    Srv-->>W: 200 (server id / version)
    W->>Room: mark SYNCED, update version
    W->>Out: remove mutation
    Room-->>VM: Flow emits -> UI shows synced
